WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Executing on-premise AI OCR using Qwen-3.5-35B and llama-server;
monitoring real-time CPU/GPU utilization across RTX 5090 and GTX 1660 Super.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Human-in-the-loop validation: token count analytics detect anomalies
when exceeding the 4,000-token safety threshold configured for the model.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Reviewing OCR hallucinations and error patterns, such as repetitive
character generation or text duplication in low-confidence regions.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Embedding extracted text chunks via Infinity-Emb server and indexing
them into Elasticsearch for high-performance semantic retrieval.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Performing real-time semantic search in a production environment
to retrieve contextually relevant document fragments instantly.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Side-by-side verification of source PDF against OCR output, including
full-text preview in a dedicated modal for detailed quality assurance.

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Implementing infinite scroll pagination to load results incrementally,
optimizing rendering performance and ensuring a seamless user experience.

8
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Executing multi-domain semantic queries to validate the system's
generalization capability across diverse technical documentation sets.